<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14254] Graceful stop rebuilding indexes when deactivating a cluster</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14254</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If in the process of rebuilding the indexes to deactivate the cluster, then a number of errors may appear, including a node fail. It is necessary to stop index rebuilding before stopping the cache.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
